# Generated Dart/Flutter artifacts. None of these are source; all are
# reproduced by `pub get`, `build_runner`, `dart doc`, or `pod install`.
# Patterns without a leading slash match at any depth, so they also cover
# example/.

# Tool and build caches.
.dart_tool/
build/
**/doc/api/

# Library lockfile. workbench_shell is a published package, not an app:
# it must resolve against a range of consumer versions, so pinning its own
# lockfile gives false confidence and has no effect on consumers.
# See https://dart.dev/tools/pub/private-files#pubspeclock.
/pubspec.lock

# CocoaPods lockfile — the pubspec.lock argument again. The example's pods
# derive from this package's own dependencies, and `pod install` rebuilds
# them on every darwin build, so pinning records nothing a consumer
# resolves against. flutter/packages ignores it; the Flutter template does
# not. Covers example/ios and example/macos.
Podfile.lock

# OS and editor noise.
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.iml
.idea/

# Symphonize/conduct local progress scratch — never commit.
*.local.md

# FVM Version Cache
.fvm/
